# Chat templates in the choice fixtures are pinned by SHA-256 and rendered
# byte for byte in tests, so check them out exactly as committed: no CRLF
# conversion under core.autocrlf on Windows.
integration-tests/fixtures/choice/templates/** -text

# build.rs compares the raw bytes of these three files with the hashes pinned
# in natives-manifest.txt before it downloads a prebuilt llama.cpp slice. A
# CRLF checkout never matches, so Windows checkouts always built llama.cpp
# from source.
crates/llama-cpp-sys/build.rs -text
crates/llama-cpp-sys/wrapper.cpp -text
crates/llama-cpp-sys/wrapper.h -text
